        },
        {
          "text": "Amaziya kajisi myaka iili makumi obile amusanu naakaba mwami, nkabela wakeendelezya mu-Jerusalemu myaka iili makumi obile amusanu aine. Izina lyabanyina bakali Joadanu waku-Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
