        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Amaziya wakabunganya ba-Juda, wababamba munzubo zyabamawisi mumaanza aabasilutwe bazyuulu abasilutwe bamyanda, musyobo waJuda amusyobo wa-Benjamini woonse. Wakaita bantu boonse ibakajisi myaka iili makumi obile na kwiinda makumi obile, nkabela kwakajanwa baalumi basalidwe basilumamba bali zyuulu zili myanda yotatwe ibakabwene kubelesya masumo azikwabilizyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
