        {
          "text": "Pele kwakamusikila umwi muntu wa-Leza, wati, O mwami, utainki abasilumamba ba-Israyeli, nkaambo Jehova tali aba-Israyeli, nkukuti aba ba-Efraimu boonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
