        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Amaziya wakaambila muntu wa-Leza kuti, Pele tucite buti kumakani aamatalenta aali mwanda ngundapa impi ya-Israyeli? Muntu wa-Leza wakavuwa kuti, Jehova ulakonzya kukupa mali manji loko kwiinda ayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Amaziya wakamwaisya basilumamba ibakamusikila kuzwa kucisi ca-Efraimu, kuti bapiluke kulimbabo. Lino bukali bwabo bwakabukila ba-Juda loko, bakapiluka kumaanda aabo abukali bunji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
