                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwe ulaamba kuti, Bona! Ndazunda ba-Edomu, Aboobo moyo wako walisumpula. Lino kala kumaanda, Nkaambonzi noyanda kubusya inkondo? Uyoowa omwini acisi ca-Juda coonse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.19",
